r":null,"call_locator":"5803185e2f8c6e716298cdf49698837903976e19815fa60f150b85567554669d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3f212f5560c341b3abd1e2f62d3f4bb96789c0a2a5dab042fd84487f26ce7caf","logical_entry_identity":"593c569729969bd5dba5546647af7040fc0bdb756006ab7b5da604cc63776544","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Dual Steamgun","source_tag":"talent name","target":"炮台双枪"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"93ae1980a4ea2f2f68a15685725f12c2147ac748e01cc7ed75b81dfd53ae508b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3f25323adcaaee18cb1da4ff65edc16603f2e4dc96acf87a9c6b71e8dfde50dd","logical_entry_identity":"2a00ce93c0840569b41e95291313bc680afed26288fe81692dc156f4aed5ce5e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Tanner","source_tag":"entity name","target":"皮革店"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"83e8aba9df9dd77163c86b7cc615a0500030e3dd3d5e8642351db69c385b763c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3f360a40151c0f7010299058e34e864675a2edc5c3f6e340952e9d1e0fb36847","logical_entry_identity":"10c0aa6c4329f46dce5911102b5a747983110020337a2e2673d87c457485cd45","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"arcane amplification drone","source_tag":"_t","target":"奥术增幅装置"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0a223511c4261b30ba3136b0ba7776c228d6df092a2580360433285e7b9ac5c6","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3f3adc1edf8de6ee8aa28492dcef0521706fcb3833ac55005f96b7873684ebee","logical_entry_identity":"43b1610578950b31b0184a6bbf5adc41ba9e5355fd2e1c1dbf45bd8d35ebe934","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"G.E.M. Command Deck","source_tag":"_t","target":"G.E.M. 控制室"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4a66f8fdf72d6cbcdfb69583dff520550453cbbee6d93460dea0ff464d134f3e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3f45cc1ed02f25a6a5c6e8e6652f1d745d1b6d3ccc3296d83800e6521847709b","logical_entry_identity":"2c34ff17f53e7ff5ec4a28bd2875ceb0ad5ec88b9c5faa33c712726724356f43","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Investigating you have found a huge mechanical mole of obvious steam giant origin.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一番调查后，你找到了一个巨大的机械鼹鼠，一定是蒸汽巨人们造的。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8db9778dcfce31590b661d40608669835c1ec66c37f8baa383c35801a096c895","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3f615510ad2c3bc4317b27ac5244b73cedaa39b6e35fc49adbb6a9dcbe50be44","logical_entry_identity":"eed84085adde2e178669bab9de9f9656357278317226d9ec6fcf7371ba62cd34","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"I don't like automatons.  Machines that operate by themselves, with no personal input...  why, they don't require any skill or ability to operate!  You need only rely on what someone else has done by inventing it!  Mark my words, our dependence on these things will be the death of us, making us weak in body and mind...  but I must admit, they have gotten the job done.  Only a few days after we brought in these arachnoid contraptions, they excavated enough of the offending cavern (and presumably purged enough of whatever pollutant was down there) that living workers are once again willing to work in the nearby areas.  I don't care if it was superstition or what, because we're going to make quota for this month - those caves had a lot of vents to work with!\n\nStill not sure why the Council confiscated the cargo from the third machine we sent down there, but whatever.  Those uppity do-nothings can keep the gold or jewels or whatever was in there.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"我不喜欢自动化。那些机器居然可以自己行动，不需要人的干涉……为什么，这根本不需要任何操纵的技巧和能力！你只需要依赖那些发明它的人所做的事情就可以了！说实话，过分依赖这种东西肯定会给我们带来末日，这会让我们的身体和精神都变得虚弱……但我必须承认，它们确实完成了任务。在我们带回来这些机械蜘蛛之后，没过几天，它们就开凿完成了那个有问题的洞穴。看来它清理掉了里面藏着的不知道是什么污染物的东西，现在工人们又重新愿意在这里干活了。我才不在乎这是不是迷信，因为我们还要完成这个月的任务呢——这些洞穴里有着这么多我们所需要的地热口！\n\n我现在也不知道，为什么议会要没收掉我们送到这里的第三台机器所挖掘出的东西，但是管他呢。不管里面是什么黄金珠宝，就让那些高高在上的废物拿去玩吧。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d90dba07e83b28cdf7dd35a66c20437c58eebfe68b67aec3fb49804521e88571","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3f7a809c28dadbd5a82b5720c257f5ccc783c0d0595286b4fb8497c79db77175","logical_entry_identity":"9aa8ac55179c7292b1cc2424606fd043ff64dd997a022d54efb9a2786a51db4b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Galvanic Rod","source_tag":"talent name","target":"放电柱"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"99bda6a74a057ea4e3e97b61b693fa182396c663a107347d8251343f02d0e716","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3f7dc08a6231aa1ce3694b034558c2da48adc26d7d56fe1fa4556051127e297e","logical_entry_identity":"da1fa01edf0d9004d1a2947466ab34eb980d4eb8a918c6b1bee8d73b393e456d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The Palace of Fumes stands in ruins, its Council shattered. The Atmos Tribe will not bother the Prides anymore.","source_tag":"_t","target":"烟雾宫殿被摧毁，议会分崩离析。气之部族不再威胁你的部落。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d3229b493758be3ef28d1f612944ff35720f369db8cfa0dad65254afc419236b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3fbaffc6c45564dfb2682edb2af83f8b6277ac4ce200b1fa54643da7ad6d735f","logical_entry_identity":"26f130ae969233ae3c89293d44d947016ad34d1b3dbb9724014d65c00f6642d9","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Fires your ammo at an enemy in range %d for %d%% weapon damage.  If this tinker is made of voratun you will fire an additional shot.\n\t\t\tThis shot is a ranged melee attack but will use the ranged procs of your ammo as well.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"向在 %d 码范围内的一个敌人开火造成 %d%% 的武器伤害。如果手炮是由沃瑞钽钢制作的，你能多一次额外的射击。射击是远程攻击将会触发弹药特效。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dbc51762f1ca7a6c139a3eee62b428c5d68dead6b535d9a2d1ab54fb57fd0977","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3fc4550ff76c45b4a33de82b1f3c618f0a1c071aa228d89a18e7d5d0e4e5ce72","logical_entry_identity":"28dfc2b76bd96352e84f437aab4d74e3c6253709f939b6f9fc9dee5a1931ef02","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"armament","source_tag":"talent type","target":"武装"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e6cbb8db4a643ab74fcb91399075ff4255bf235134a04cc3f43cb8d46cc7e6b2","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3fc4e103ebd784ee1828a96656b0436d9aca0ad0fb8422